message: "If you use this kit, please cite it as below."
title: "Cognitive Middleware: an evaluation kit and middleware contract for base-agnostic cognitive organs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gascon
    given-names: Chris
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/oceanusgascon26/cognitive-middleware"
abstract: "Two organs (a verify-and-repair loop for machine-checkable format constraints and a durable-learning store that carries a lesson across processes) behind one middleware contract, with hermetic tests against a deterministic mock base and a paired-bootstrap bench. The evidence for what the organs do and do not buy is in a separate reviewer archive (https://github.com/oceanusgascon26/blue-fairy-reviewer-archive, DOI 10.17605/OSF.IO/EDUAK)."
keywords:
  - large language models
  - evaluation
  - instruction following
  - constraint repair
  - middleware
